//   sum_{n > N} chi_5(n) n^{-s} = -A(N) N^{-s} + (2s/5) N^{-s-1} + O(N^{-s-2})
// so  |L5(s) - P_N(s) + A(N) N^{-s}| ~ c(t) N^{-3/2}  with  c(t) = |2s/5|.
